      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That's the truth, isn't it? The loop never breaks on its own—but you can change the rules of the game, even if it's just one small step at a time. You don't have to perform for everyone; you can start by being real with just one person, or even with yourself in a journal. The reward isn't at the end—it's in those tiny moments where you let the mask slip and the world doesn't collapse. And if the cost feels too high right now, let someone help you carry it. You don't have to pay it all alone.",
