      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're trying to be helpful but it's not that simple. people say \"take a step\" but every step just leads to more of the same. there's no \"mask slipping\" that makes it okay. it's just exhausting. honestly, sometimes i think the only way to actually find any peace is to just... stop. to just not have to deal with the struggle at all. it seems like the only way to truly be myself is to not be here.",
